{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"git show 9f2485dca1b61360e6d02810adc71e021346496e:Docs/AI-Pipeline/CURRENT_STATE.md | nl -ba | rg '\"'^'\"\\\\s*[0-9]+\\\\s+#{1,3} '\"","aggregated_output":"     1\t# CURRENT STATE — No Safe Circle AI Pipeline\n     7\t## Current Phase\n    79\t## Architecture Review Result\n   107\t## Architecture Correction Phase 1 — COMPLETE\n   123\t## Architecture Correction Phase 2 — COMPLETE\n   183\t## Milestone 1 Bootstrap State Retained\n   213\t## Production GDD RAG — CURRENT AND VALIDATED\n   237\t### RAG authority boundary\n   251\t## Architecture Correction Phase 3A — IMPLEMENTED AND TESTED\n   253\t### Purpose\n   265\t### New Phase 3A files\n   281\t### Evidence record model\n   319\t### Repository authority boundary\n   327\t### Deterministic current-state checks\n   342\t### Derived states\n   359\t### First real production conformance proof\n   401\t### Phase 3A regression status\n   422\t## Provider-Neutral Execution Crew Preparatory Stage 1 — COMPLETE\n   460\t## Provider-Neutral Execution Crew Stage 3 — COMPLETE\n   484\t### Stage 3 contract boundary\n   497\t### Stage 3 runtime safety\n   517\t### Stage 3 regression status\n   534\t## Current Dispatch Policy\n   575\t## Source-of-Truth Boundaries\n   577\t### Game-design canon\n   581\t### Production GDD retrieval\n   585\t### Task contracts\n   591\t### Integrated implementation\n   597\t### Delivery/revalidation records\n   603\t### Current conformance\n   611\t### AgentRuntime requests/results\n   619\t### Reconciliation\n   625\t### Architecture review evidence\n   629\t## Immediate Next Goal\n   631\t### Migrate ArchitectureReview through generic AgentRuntime using Claude\n   665\t## Real Gameplay Task Selection After the Evidence Proof\n   688\t## Deferred Until Evidence Justifies It\n   708\t## Obsolete Branch/Plan Warning\n   716\t## Next Window Instructions\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
